			"Message": "docs(Output): Document deep-shim tier compatibility in README and Architecture\n\nAdd a Shim Compatibility table to both `Documentation/GitHub/README.md` (new file) and `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` detailing the two-tier interception system — 🟠 Low-Level Shim (`TierShim=Own|Preempt`) for engine prototype hooks, and 🔵 Coverage Shim (`TierShim=Proxy|Replace`) for service routing and audit.\n\nAlso creates the standalone README.md for the Output Element with a concise description and cross-reference to Architecture.md, making the repository discoverable from the GitHub organization overview.\n\nThe shim documentation references `Source/Plugin/Transform/Inject/Shim/Hook.ts` as the compile-time injection site and `Source/Service/CEL/Land/Shim/` (7 files) as the runtime layer, giving downstream consumers and contributors a clear architectural map.",
